body:
I ended up overriding the `transform` property.

What I did:
1. Install `@swc/core` and `@swc/jest`.
2. Adding the following inside `jest.config.ts`:
```ts
transform: {
        "^.+\\.(js|jsx|ts|tsx|mjs)$": [
            "@swc/jest",
            {
                jsc: {
                    transform: {
                        react: {
                            runtime: "automatic",
                        },
                    },
                },
            },
        ],
    },
```
